    "detailed_description": "Song of Nothing is an Action Hack and Slash game with dark gothic alternate remnant of the Napoleonic Wars. <br />\r\nChoose one of many character Classes and journey with Jack the Tortured to the end of the Nothing. <br />\r\nFight Victorian era monstrosities. <br />\r\nStrengthen your characters abilities. <br />\r\nCreate your own powerful builds. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;With any luck you will reach the end of the nothing, before everyone completely loses their minds.&quot;<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n- Character Class Build progression<br />\r\n- Large selection of diverse abilities, traits, and items, all enabling you to create interesting synergies<br />\r\n- Several distinct characters allowing for many different play styles<br />\r\n- Find rare item variants to further improve your builds<br />\r\n- Unlock portions of the town of Safe haven of the Nothing.",
    "about_the_game": "Song of Nothing is an Action Hack and Slash game with dark gothic alternate remnant of the Napoleonic Wars. <br />\r\nChoose one of many character Classes and journey with Jack the Tortured to the end of the Nothing. <br />\r\nFight Victorian era monstrosities. <br />\r\nStrengthen your characters abilities. <br />\r\nCreate your own powerful builds. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;With any luck you will reach the end of the nothing, before everyone completely loses their minds.&quot;<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n- Character Class Build progression<br />\r\n- Large selection of diverse abilities, traits, and items, all enabling you to create interesting synergies<br />\r\n- Several distinct characters allowing for many different play styles<br />\r\n- Find rare item variants to further improve your builds<br />\r\n- Unlock portions of the town of Safe haven of the Nothing.",
    "short_description": "Fight through the twisted Napolean era nightmares of the nothing in this Hack and Slash adventure. Go solo, or with a party to reach the end of the nothing before everyone loses their minds. Chose your abilities, and master combos, while unlocking new areas of solstice along the way.",
